                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/2816: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Chile</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Culbertson</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-01-24T12:00:00-04:00">January 24,
                        1933—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received 12:40 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>17. Chilean Minister for Foreign Affairs will today propose to the Argentine
                    Minister for Foreign Affairs conference at Mendoza on Thursday. He has
                    surrounded the move with mystery but told me that he is willing to withdraw or
                    modify his proposal if it will help bring peace in the Chaco.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Culbertson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
